      "section_heading_before": "四、解答题：本题共 5 小题，共 77 分。解答应写出文字说明、证明过程或演算步骤。",
      "question_markdown": "15. (本小题满分 13 分)\n已知全集 $U=\\{x|x\\leqslant 4\\}$，集合 $A=\\{x|-2<x<3\\}$，$B=\\{x|-3\\leqslant x\\leqslant 2\\}$，求：\n(1) $A\\cap B$；\n(2) $(\\complement_U A)\\cup B$；\n(3) $A\\cap (\\complement_U B)$。",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C001"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v3",
        "symbol_audit_target_count": 0,
        "symbol_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_version": "figure_audit_v1",
        "figure_audit_target_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_observations": [],
        "lint_actions": [
          "kept_first_pass_answer_byte_exact"
        ],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/test_runs/04-api2-triple-average/qwen3.7-plus/workflow/page28/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "(1) $\\because A=\\{x|-2<x<3\\}$，$B=\\{x|-3\\leqslant x\\leqslant 2\\}$\n$\\therefore A\\cap B=\\{x|-2<x\\leqslant 2\\}$。\n(2) $\\because A=\\{x|-2<x<3\\}$，$U=\\{x|x\\leqslant 4\\}$\n$\\therefore \\complement_U A=\\{x|x\\leqslant -2$ 或 $3\\leqslant x\\leqslant 4\\}$。\n$\\therefore (\\complement_U A)\\cup B=\\{x|x\\leqslant 2$ 或 $3\\leqslant x\\leqslant 4\\}$。\n(3) $\\because B=\\{x|-3\\leqslant x\\leqslant 2\\}$，$U=\\{x|x\\leqslant 4\\}$\n$\\therefore \\complement_U B=\\{x|x<-3$ 或 $2<x\\leqslant 4\\}$。\n$\\therefore A\\cap (\\complement_U B)=\\{x|2<x<3\\}$。",
