      "section_heading_before": "",
      "question_markdown": "16. (本小题满分 15 分)\n记全集 $U=\\mathbf{R}$，集合 $A=\\{x|a-2\\leqslant x\\leqslant 2a+1, a\\in \\mathbf{R}\\}$，$B=\\{x|x\\leqslant 3$，或 $x\\geqslant 7\\}$。\n(1) 若 $A\\cup B=\\mathbf{R}$，求 $a$ 的取值范围；\n(2) 若 $A\\cap B=A$，求 $a$ 的取值范围。",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C002"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v3",
        "symbol_audit_target_count": 0,
        "symbol_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_version": "figure_audit_v1",
        "figure_audit_target_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_observations": [],
        "lint_actions": [
          "kept_first_pass_answer_byte_exact"
        ],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/test_runs/04-api2-triple-average/qwen3.7-plus/workflow/page28/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "(1) $\\because A\\cup B=\\mathbf{R}$\n$\\therefore \\begin{cases} a-2\\leqslant 3 \\\\ 2a+1\\geqslant 7 \\end{cases}$ 得 $3\\leqslant a\\leqslant 5$\n$\\therefore a$ 取值范围 $\\{a|3\\leqslant a\\leqslant 5\\}$。\n(2) $A\\cap B=A \\therefore A\\subseteq B$\n$a-2>2a+1 \\Rightarrow a<-3$\n$A\\neq \\varnothing \\quad a-2\\leqslant 2a+1 \\quad a\\geqslant -3$\n$\\because A\\subseteq B \\therefore a-2>7$ 或 $2a+1<3$\n$\\therefore$ 综上 $a\\leqslant 1$ 或 $a>9$。$\\therefore \\{a|a\\leqslant 1$ 或 $a>9\\}$。",
